dsh-opencode-go-multi-quota README · How accounts are discovered：On every request the host reads the loaded `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-pi-ai` entry and its `config.providers`. A provider is included when it has an `apiKeyEnv` and any of these is true:

- the provider id starts with `opencode`;
- its `baseURL` contains `opencode.ai`;
- its `apiKeyEnv` contains `OPENCODE`.

The `apiKeyEnv` value is the credential ref to resolve. Providers with only a stored credential record and no `apiKeyEnv` are not shown.

dsh-opencode-go-multi-quota README · Install：```sh
dsh plugin --profile desktop add github:jackgucarbon/dsh-opencode-go-multi-quota
```

```json
{
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "dsh-opencode-go-multi-quota"]

After installation, restart DSH if the host half does not reload, then refresh the page.
